'''Yakuza Vampire''' (ヤクザヴァンパイア, ''Yakuza Vanpaia'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Yakuza Apocalypse Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 3.5 Update|Version 3.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Yakuza Vampire
|image = E 162.png
|appearance = [[Yakuza Apocalypse Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 893円 - 3,527円
}}

==Enemy==
Just like [[Mob Cat (Enemy)|Mob Cat]], this enemy has rather low stats except for its health, so units like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] are easily able to deal with the unit standing at a safe distance. Its 20% chance to [[Freeze|freeze]] cats isn't much to take note of as due to its low range, it is most likely to only freeze the player's meatshields and not much else.

==Strategy==
Use three or four meatshields, such as [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] or [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Samba Cat]]. You should also use cats that can outrange it like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] or [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]]. Units such as [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] or [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] are not as effective due to being outranged, this wouldn't be a problem if it weren't for Yakuza Vampire's [[Freeze|freeze]].

