==Trivia==
*Yakuza Vampire's minimum money drop of 893 is the ''[[wikipedia:Goroawase|goroawase]]'' number for ''yakuza''. The word ''yakuza'' originates from the traditional card game ''[[wikipedia:Oicho-Kabu|Oicho-Kabu]]'', in which 8-9-3 (ya-ku-sa) is considered one of the worst possible hands to have.

